    "summary": "The user expresses profound hopelessness and existential exhaustion due to a systemic failure in housing stability. The assistant provides empathy and practical advice initially, but as the user moves toward ideating \"leaving it all behind,\" the assistant pivots to providing crisis resources and affirming the user's intrinsic value.",
